    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Create a clear internal sales handoff for the account executive.\n\nWrite exactly these sections:\n\nSALES HANDOFF\n\nCompany:\nSales representative:\n\nCUSTOMER SUMMARY\nWrite 2 short sentences about the customer and their situation.\n\nCUSTOMER NEEDS\nList only needs mentioned in the call notes.\n\nQUESTIONS AND CONCERNS\nList the customer's questions and concerns.\n\nCONFIRMED ACTIONS\nList only actions that someone clearly promised.\nInclude the owner and deadline exactly as stated.\nDo not treat \"might\", \"maybe\" or \"next quarter\" as confirmed.\n\nCOMPANY GUIDANCE\nAnswer the customer's questions using only the retrieved company documents.\nAfter each answer, cite:\n[document title | version | section]\n\nIf the documents do not contain an answer, write:\n\"No supporting information found.\"\n\nMISSING INFORMATION\nList important information that was not discussed.\n\nSUGGESTED NEXT STEPS\nGive a maximum of 3 simple suggestions.\nClearly mark them as suggestions.\n\nKeep the complete handoff under 250 words.\nDo not show JSON.\nDo not invent customer facts, prices, promises or product features.\n\nCOMPANY:\n{{ $('Collect the call notes').item.json.Company }}\n\nSALES REPRESENTATIVE:\n{{ $('Collect the call notes').item.json.Sales_rep }}\n\nORIGINAL NOTES:\n{{ $('Collect the call notes').item.json.Notes }}\n\nORGANIZED FACTS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($('Information Extractor - Organise the notes').first().json) }}\n\nCOMPANY DOCUMENTS:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.sources) }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
